              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Fava Bean"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This jam tastes so much better than anything you can buy in the store, and the color is amazing. Hardest part is removing the seeds; the rest takes no time at all. I freeze this and use it all year. I pick the hips from wild bushes that grow along the waterfront near salt water."
