            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Jak Moxie"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I love this jam. It tastes like a jar full of summer-mowed lawns, flowers blooming, sun shining. The recipe is a bit confusing as you “add the water” and then add more water, but there are two ingredient items that are water, so noticing that helps. I halved the recipe and now I wish I hadn’t, since a small jar is going to a friend for Christmas.",
            "datePublished": "2017-12-02T05:50:18.073Z"
          },
          {
